Am un fișier PDF care conține atât text, cât și imagini și vreau să-l transform într-un ebook EPUB curat și compatibil cu principalele platforme de lectură (Kindle, Apple Books, Kobo, etc.).  

Ce îmi doresc concret:  
• conversia fidelă a formatării existente (stiluri de titlu, subtitluri, paragrafe, liste, imagini aliniate corect);  
• câteva hyperlink-uri active acolo unde le indic eu;  
• un cuprins interactiv (indice) care să permită saltul rapid către fiecare capitol;  
• fișier final validat EPUB 3, fără erori la verificare (EpubCheck).  

Îți voi trimite PDF-ul original și, dacă este nevoie, o listă cu paginile unde trebuie inserate linkurile. Aștept la final fișierul .epub și, opțional, un raport scurt despre eventualele ajustări efectuate.

Devo tradurre dall’italiano all’inglese la presentazione formale di un programma televisivo: 8 pagine per un totale di circa 2 980 parole.  

Mi aspetto:  
• una resa scorrevole e professionale in inglese che conservi il registro formale dell’originale;  
• uso corretto della terminologia tipica del settore TV (format, slot, share, ecc.);  
• fedeltà alla struttura grafica e ai paragrafi del file di partenza;  
• rispetto assoluto della riservatezza dei contenuti.  

Invierò il documento in Word; desidero ricevere lo stesso file con il testo tradotto, pronto per essere presentato a network e potenziali partner internazionali. Non è una sceneggiatura né un reportage, ma una presentazione destinata a decision-maker, quindi accuratezza e tono istituzionale sono fondamentali.  

Indicami tempi di consegna concreti, eventuali referenze simili e — se previsto — un rapido esempio di traduzione di due o tre frasi che possa valutare stile e precisione.

I’m looking for an electronics / embedded hardware engineer to help turn an existing PI/TDEM hardware design into a working, bench-tested prototype.
The project is already substantially developed. I already have the engineering architecture, circuit concepts, component work, connection details, timing approach, and implementation planning.
This is not a design-from-scratch project.
I mainly need someone who can:
- review the existing engineering package only as needed for implementation;
- complete or correct schematic/PCB work where necessary;
- prepare manufacturing files and BOM;
- work with STM32 firmware and ADC acquisition;
- handle pulsed MOSFET / inductive coil hardware;
- assemble and bring up the prototype;
- perform oscilloscope and LCR measurements;
- debug the electronics;
- bench-test the system and make necessary first-prototype corrections.
Practical bench experience is important.
Preferred experience:
- PCB design and mixed-signal electronics
- low-noise analog circuits
- STM32
- power electronics / MOSFET switching
- inductive loads or coils
- ADC/data acquisition
- hardware debugging and prototype testing
The project is privately funded and the budget is limited, so I’m looking for a practical, cost-effective implementation partner rather than a large consultancy.
Please provide your approximate engineering cost separately from components, PCB fabrication/assembly, and testing costs.
I am based in London, but the final prototype is intended for Dubai, UAE.

B2B Sales Agent / Long-Term Business Partner — IT & Software Development

We are a team of strong engineers specializing in Backend, Frontend, Data Engineering, AI, and DevOps.

We are currently preparing for the next stage of our development — moving into a more serious B2B market and taking on larger and more complex projects.

And this is exactly when we want to find someone who can grow into this next stage with us.

We are not looking for a sales freelancer who simply brings in individual clients. We are looking for a B2B Sales Agent / Business Development Partner who can first work with us on several real projects, see how we work together, build an effective process with the team, and then continue growing with us on a long-term basis.

Your Role

* Identify and approach potential B2B clients;
* Reach decision-makers and establish initial contact;
* Understand business needs and identify potential opportunities;
* Present our technical capabilities and possible solutions;
* Lead commercial communication and negotiations;
* Work closely with our engineering team when shaping a solution for the client;
* Build and maintain long-term client relationships.

From the technical side, our team handles architecture, technical assessment, specialist selection, and project delivery.

Who We Are Looking For

We are looking for an independent B2B sales professional who understands how to work with businesses, identify commercial opportunities, and build meaningful client relations

J’ai un document PDF de plus de 51 pages rédigé en français et composé quasi exclusivement de texte. Je souhaite recevoir une version .docx entièrement éditable qui respecte la structure d’origine : titres, sauts de paragraphe, gras/italique, numérotation et en-têtes ou pieds de page éventuels.

Vous devrez :
• effectuer l’OCR si le texte n’est pas déjà sélectionnable ;
• vérifier que les caractères spéciaux et accents restent corrects ;
• livrer un fichier Word stable, sans éléments déformés ni images déplacées.

Je n’attends qu’un seul livrable : le fichier Word final prêt à être modifié. Si vous maîtrisez des outils comme Adobe Acrobat, ABBYY FineReader ou équivalent, précisez-le dans votre proposition ainsi que votre délai estimé.

Ho appena terminato il mio libro e sono pronto a spingerlo sul mercato: l’obiettivo principale è aumentare le vendite, non semplicemente la visibilità.  

Il canale che voglio sfruttare è Amazon Ads: credo sia la piattaforma più diretta per raggiungere i lettori di romanzi, il pubblico che intendo intercettare fin da subito. Sono comunque aperto a suggerimenti complementari (Google Ads, ad esempio) se dovessero rivelarsi utili a potenziare la stessa strategia di vendita, ma la priorità resta Amazon.

Mi occorre quindi un professionista che:  
• analizzi il libro, il suo posizionamento e le parole chiave più pertinenti;  
• imposti campagne Sponsored Products e, se opportuno, Sponsored Brands;  
• scriva headline e copy persuasivi, in linea con il tono narrativo del mio romanzo;  
• monitori e ottimizzi CPC, targeting e budget su base continuativa, con report chiari sui risultati di conversione.

Accetterò il lavoro quando vedrò:  
1. campagne attive su Amazon Ads, complete di keyword research documentata;  
2. prime metriche di vendita/conversione tracciate dopo il periodo di test concordato;  
3. un piano di ottimizzazione con azioni e tempi specifici.  

Fornirò sin da subito sinossi, copertina ad alta risoluzione e qualsiasi altro materiale utile. Aspetto la tua proposta per pianificare insieme la scalata delle vendite.

I am approaching hand-over on a construction project and must bring in a Chartered Engineer registered with the Institution of Engineering and Technology to provide independent technical consultancy for the final inspection and certification stage.  

Scope  
The structure is complete, services are live, and all as-built documentation is ready. What I need now is an IET-chartered professional who can:  
• carry out a site visit (UK location) to verify that the built works match drawings, specifications, and current Building Regulations;  
• review electrical and mechanical installations for compliance with BS and IET standards;  
• highlight any residual defects or safety issues;  
• issue a formal engineer’s inspection report and completion certificate that can be presented to building control, insurers, and the client.  

Acceptance criteria  
Your certificate must reference the relevant clauses of the regulations you have checked, include your IET chartered registration number, and be delivered in PDF format within five working days of the inspection.  

If this fits your chartered remit and you have recent experience signing off construction projects at practical completion, please outline your availability for a site visit and examples of similar certifications you have issued.

Project Background
We are developing road trip travel planning solutions and require insights into the typical driving routes, positioning patterns and trajectory characteristics of commercial transport vehicles. The first phase will be a small-scale pilot test; should the results meet expectations, we will increase the budget and scale up the cooperation.

## Requirements
1. Provide testing access to GPS monitoring and trajectory data for no fewer than 100 commercial transport vehicles;
2. The account or data access shall be valid for a minimum of 30 days;
3. We will first conduct a 7-day usability verification;
4. The solution shall support real-time positioning checks, historical trajectory queries, and trajectory data export/download;
5. The data will be used exclusively for road trip route planning analysis, and will not be disclosed to third parties or used for any illegal purposes.

## Partner Qualifications
- Only test accounts with written authorization from fleet owners, logistics companies or GPS platform operators will be accepted;
- Partners shall clearly define the scope of data authorization and usage restrictions;
- Logistics companies, GPS service providers and transport enterprises with owned fleet resources are preferred.

## Delivery and Acceptance
- Phase 1: 7-day trial verification, to confirm normal account login, accessible positioning and trajectory data, and functional data export;
- Phase 2: 30-day formal cooperation upon successful verification;
